  "prefLabel": "Nur 608.03 Nurse Extern Practice",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 608.03 Nurse Extern Practice. A nurse extern may, under the supervision of the nurse extern preceptor, perform any nursing task for which they have, through education or experience, demonstrated competency in.\n\nSource. #13707, 9-27-23; ss by #14636, eff 8-24-26, EXPIRES: 8-24-36 (formerly Nur 608.04)",
